From: Deniston_Antony <deniston2k@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:46:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] Add MolmoBot options for a blocked camera and a pushed
 close

`camera_fallback` uses the other shoulder camera when the picked one sees almost nothing. `close_push_after` gives a close task straight pushes of the closed gripper when the arm is slow after that many calls. `arm.py` holds the FR3 kinematics for the push.
